{"id":323,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"The humps on Camerupt’s back are formed by a transformation of its bones. They sometimes blast out molten magma. This Pokémon apparently erupts often when it is enraged."},{"games":["Omega Ruby"],"text":"Camerupt has a volcano inside its body. Magma of 18,000 degrees Fahrenheit courses through its body. Occasionally, the humps on this Pokémon’s back erupt, spewing the superheated magma."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"If angered, the humps on its back erupt in a shower of molten lava. It lives in the craters of volcanoes."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"The volcanoes on its back have a major eruption every 10 years--or whenever it becomes really angry."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It lives in the crater of a volcano. It is well known that the humps on its back erupt every 10 years."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A POKéMON that lives in the crater of a volcano. Every 10 years, the volcanoes on its back erupt violently. Research is under way on the cause of eruption."},{"games":["Ruby"],"text":"CAMERUPT has a volcano inside its body. Magma of 18,000 degrees F courses through its body. Occasionally, the humps on this POKéMON’s back erupt, spewing the superheated magma."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Magma Armor","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon’s hot magma coating prevents it from being frozen."},{"name":"Solid Rock","hidden":false,"description":"Reduces the power of supereffective attacks that hit the Pokémon."},{"name":"Anger Point","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon is angered when it takes a critical hit, and that maxes its Attack stat."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"mountain","color":"Red","shape":"Quadrupe